{"id":23,"text":"In summer, the sun was hot and the fields were green. A grasshopper played music and sang all day.\n\nAn ant walked past. She carried a big piece of corn.\n\n“Why do you work so hard?” asked the grasshopper. “Come and play with me!”\n\n“I am getting food for winter,” said the ant. “You should do it too.”\n\nThe grasshopper laughed. “Winter is far away. Today is a good day!” He kept singing.\n\nThe ant worked every day. She carried food to her home and stored it safely.\n\nThen winter came. It was cold, and snow covered everything. The grasshopper had no food and no house. He was hungry and cold.\n\nHe went to the ant’s door. “Please, can you give me some food?” he asked.\n\nThe ant looked at him kindly. “You played all summer,” she said. “But I will help you this time. Next summer, please prepare.”\n\nThe grasshopper ate and felt warm. He learned his lesson.\n\nMoral: Work today, and tomorrow will be easier.","tr":null,"gl":{"in":"ichida, -da","summer":"yoz","the":"(aniq artikl)","sun":"quyosh","was":"edi","hot":"issiq","and":"va","fields":"dalalar","were":"edi(lar)","green":"yashil","a":"bir (noaniq artikl)","grasshopper":"chigirtka","played":"o'ynadi; chaldi","music":"musiqa","sang":"kuyladi","all":"hamma, barcha","day":"kun","an":"bir (noaniq artikl)","ant":"chumoli","walked":"yurdi","past":"o'tmish; yonidan","she":"u (ayol)","carried":"olib bordi, tashidi","big":"katta","piece":"bo'lak","of":"-ning; -dan","corn":"makkajo'xori","why":"nega","do":"qilmoq","you":"sen, siz","work":"ishlamoq; ish","so":"shuning uchun; shunday","hard":"qattiq; qiyin","asked":"so'radi","come":"kelmoq","play":"o'ynamoq; chalmoq","with":"bilan","me":"meni, menga","i":"men","am":"-man (to be)","getting":"bo'layotgan","food":"ovqat","for":"uchun; davomida","winter":"qish","said":"dedi","should":"kerak (maslahat)","it":"u (narsa)","too":"ham; juda","laughed":"kuldi","is":"-dir (to be)","far":"uzoq","away":"uzoqqa, nari","today":"bugun","good":"yaxshi","he":"u (erkak)","kept